    - documented how to wire heartbeat.server.connected into ~/.developer-dashboard/config/config.json with user-owned collectors

0.02 2026-04-20
    - corrected the docs to describe heartbeat as an operational DD status skill
    - updated README examples to match the current truncated now payload behavior

0.01 2026-04-20
    - gated the existing heartbeat skill through docs, tests, coverage, commit, and push
    - refactored the CLI into a testable module while preserving behavior
    - documented installation, prompt indicator usage, and heartbeat collector behavior
